# dagsterplus Provider

> **Early Development** — this provider is a work in progress. Resources and APIs may change between releases. Please report any issues on [GitHub](https://github.com/dagster-io/terraform-provider-dagster-plus/issues).

Manage [Dagster+](https://dagster.cloud) resources declaratively with Terraform — deployments, code locations, teams, alert policies, secrets, and more.

## Installation

{{ codefile "hcl" "examples/provider/main.tf" }}

## Authentication

The provider requires a Dagster+ API token and your organization name. Both can be supplied via provider configuration or environment variables:

| Attribute      | Environment Variable         |
|----------------|------------------------------|
| `organization` | `DAGSTER_CLOUD_ORGANIZATION` |
| `api_token`    | `DAGSTER_CLOUD_API_TOKEN`    |

Generate a token at **Dagster+ → Account Settings → API Tokens**.

